{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S05等短停留段的未标时感受词偏密，且S11把“即使对方不需要也愿意陪伴”改成“承认自己需要对方”，改变了原本的心理重点。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的重点词放大加亮，话与感受交替，能让观众先抓住人物此刻的心理，再从较小的感受词里补充细节；到时出现的提示也让文字更贴合音乐进程。反复出现的船、水波、摇荡、靠岸等意象，把不同段落连成一段连续的情绪经历，音乐和身体感受也比Y更细腻具体。Y的心理因果叙述有时更完整、更忠实，但整体更像一边读故事一边看感受词，X更容易让普通观众边听边抓住重点。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "962eeb9a-e8ab-402d-aca1-af35caeeb686", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T090855181291Z", "elapsed_seconds": 99.375, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T09:10:34.560527+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "cdf3c6650896c712ae586db408e5d236690e1f3b53c38a94bd24b4d2911e6cbd", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web